# ----- PRODUITS (Hashes) -----
HSET product:101 name "Laptop Pro 15" category "electronics" price 1299 stock 45 brand "TechCorp" rating 4.5
HSET product:102 name "Wireless Mouse" category "electronics" price 49 stock 230 brand "TechCorp" rating 4.2
HSET product:103 name "USB-C Hub" category "electronics" price 79 stock 120 brand "ConnectPlus" rating 4.7
